{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Guide [C]me, [G]O [Am7]  Thou [G]great [Am]Je[G]ho[D]vah,
[G]Pilgrim [C]through [Am7]this [G]bar[D7]ren [G]land.
[G]I [C]am [G]wea[Am7]k, but [G]Thou [Am]art [G]might[D]y;
[G]Hold [C]me [G]with [Am7]Thy [G]power[D]ful [G]hand.
[D7]Bread [G]of [D7]heaven, [G]bread [D7]of [G]heaven,
Feed me [D7]till I [Em7]want no [D]more[D7];
[G]Feed [D7]me [G]till [C]I [G]want [D7]no [G]more.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G][C]Open [G][Am7]now [G]the [Am][G]crystal [D]fountain,
[G]whence [C]the [Am7]healing [G]stream [D7]doth [G]flow;
[G][C]let [G]the [Am7]fire [G][Am]and [G]cloudy [D]pillar
[G][C]lead [G]me [Am7]all [G]my [D]journey [G]through.
[D7][G]Strong [D7]deliverer, [G][D7]strong [G]deliverer,
[D7]be [Em7]thou still [D]my strength [D7]and shield;
[G]be [D7]thou [G]still [C]my [G]strength [D7]and [G]shield.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G][C]When [G]I [Am7]tread [G]the [Am]verge [G]of [D]Jordan,
[G][C]bid [Am7]my [G]anxious [D7]fears [G]subside;
[G][C]death [G]of [Am7]death [G][Am]and [G]hell's [D]destruction,
[G][C]land [G]me [Am7]safe [G]on [D]Canaan's [G]side.
[D7]Songs [G]of [D7]praises, [G]songs [D7]of [G]praises,
[D7]I [Em7]will ever [D]give [D7]to thee;
[G][D7]I [G]will [C]ever [G]give [D7]to [G]thee.
{end_of_verse}
